Discover a development designed for those who value comfort, functionality, and excellent finishes. These units stand out for their contemporary architecture, high-quality materials, and a carefully selected range of equipment that ensures well-being and everyday efficiency.

Features:

- One en-suite bedroom and two additional bedrooms;

- Three bathrooms;

- Furnished kitchen equipped with Bosch appliances;

- Living and dining room;

- Air conditioning;

